<title>JAPAN: Toyota falls on lower sales target report.</title>
<headline>Toyota falls on lower sales target report.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp's shares fell on Monday morning, depressed by a media report that the car maker had lowered its domestic sales target for calendar 1997, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0029 GMT, the shares were down 140 yen or 3.99 percent at 3,370, making Toyota the 10th largest percentage loser on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
